    optimistic 0.5p
    most_likely 1p
    pessimistic 2p
  status done
  requires:
    cr001 1
  owner "user and codex"
  source "Owner 2026-09-28 request to PERT-ize read-only inconsistency audit; V3-only new battles, retired V2 new battles, historical fixed-revision continuation"

